use show from benson

-- The open ground around the Shrine (ADR 0084) owns its Surface Region: the
-- player's arrival there is told here. The Shrine is at peace once the energy
-- crystal is fixed in it.
on arrived
  ask world to fixed "energy crystal"
  if it then
    show "THE SHRINE IS AT PEACE" and wait
  else
    show "A SHRINE STANDS HERE" and wait
  end if
end arrived
